Patch: trimAllocs
Letter: I
Requires: none
Files: src/datetime.js, src/duration.js, src/impl/diff.js
Summary: objects built to be read once and dropped: clone's config, as()'s Duration, endOf's calendar-boundary chain, diff's single-lower-unit merge
